(7124068, 1089352, 170281, '<td valign="top">Great quality photo.  As I always say, there is nothing like good black and white.  I am wondering if the bands on the face could have been substituted with a sinister grin.  Sometimes less is more.  Good work.</td>', 'Great quality photo.  As I always say, there is nothing like good black and white.  I am wondering if the bands on the face could have been substituted with a sinister grin.  Sometimes less is more.  Good work.', '2013-10-31 22:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7124070, 1088290, 170281, '<td valign="top">Nice editing.  The graininess has good effect and coloring is wonderful.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice editing.  The graininess has good effect and coloring is wonderful.  Good work.', '2013-10-31 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
