(7126072, 1089169, 12611, '<td valign="top">Being someone who did the same style shot, and not half as well, I commend you and I really liked the feel of the shot. I particularly liked the red rawness of the eye. There is a prisoner of war -Gitmo meets mummy feel here as well, and the lighting is spot on as well. <br/> <br/>(If this all occurred in front of an impossibly beautiful tropical harbor sunset, you avg score might have been 8.5)</td>', 'Being someone who did the same style shot, and not half as well, I commend you and I really liked the feel of the shot. I particularly liked the red rawness of the eye. There is a prisoner of war -Gitmo meets mummy feel here as well, and the lighting is spot on as well.  (If this all occurred in front of an impossibly beautiful tropical harbor sunset, you avg score might have been 8.5)', '2013-11-06 08:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
